@startuml dfd_level0
' --------------------------------------------------------------
' DFD Level 0 (Context Diagram) for the Clinix System
' Yourdon/DeMarco notation, no stick-figure actors.
' Lavender styling to match the standard textbook look.
' Uses PlantUML CSS <style> blocks (replaces deprecated
' skinparam padding warning).
' --------------------------------------------------------------
title Clinix - Data Flow Diagram Level 0 (Context Diagram)

<style>
root {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontName        "Inter, Helvetica, sans-serif"
  FontSize        12
  FontColor       #1F2937
}
rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E8ECFB
  LineColor       #6B7AB3
  LineThickness   1.4
  FontStyle       bold
  FontColor       #1F2937
  RoundCorner     6
  Padding         8
  Margin          10
}
usecase {
  BackgroundColor #DCE3F7
  LineColor       #6B7AB3
  LineThickness   1.6
  FontStyle       bold
  FontSize        12
  FontColor       #1F2937
  Padding         10
  Margin          12
}
arrow {
  LineColor       #6B7AB3
  LineThickness   1.1
  FontColor       #4A5568
  FontSize        10
}
</style>

skinparam Nodesep 90
skinparam Ranksep 120

' ---- External entities (rectangles) ----
rectangle "Patient"                   as Patient
rectangle "Healthcare\nProvider"      as Provider
rectangle "Superadmin"                as Admin
rectangle "Payment Gateway\n(CamPay)" as Gateway

' ---- Central process (numbered bubble) ----
usecase "0\nClinix System" as System

' ---- One-way data flows with short labels ----
Patient  --> System  : symptoms,\nappointments
System   --> Patient : results,\nnotifications

Provider --> System  : credentials,\nconsultations
System   --> Provider : appointments,\nearnings

Admin    --> System  : verifications,\nmanagement
System   --> Admin   : reports

Gateway  --> System  : payment\nconfirmation
System   --> Gateway : payment\nrequest
@enduml
